     The SSPPLLAAYY__IINNSSEERRTT() macro inserts the new element _e_l_m into the tree.

     The SSPPLLAAYY__RREEMMOOVVEE() macro removes the element _e_l_m from the tree pointed by
     _h_e_a_d.

     The SSPPLLAAYY__FFIINNDD() macro can be used to find a particular element in the
     tree.

           struct TYPE find, *res;
           find.key = 30;
