     particular tree.  The _T_Y_P_E argument is the type of the structure that is
     being managed by the tree.  The _F_I_E_L_D argument is the name of the element
     defined by RRBB__EENNTTRRYY().  Individual prototypes can be declared with
     RRBB__PPRROOTTOOTTYYPPEE__IINNSSEERRTT(), RRBB__PPRROOTTOOTTYYPPEE__IINNSSEERRTT__CCOOLLOORR(),
