     terparts, they permit both the removal of np as well as freeing it from
     within the loop safely without interfering with the traversal.

     Both RRBB__FFOORREEAACCHH__FFRROOMM() and RRBB__FFOORREEAACCHH__RREEVVEERRSSEE__FFRROOMM() may be used to con‐
